// offset 3, no MS2 node library) that fades particles where they approach the scene depth: the vertex shader passes the
// screen position (GetScreenPosition) through a texture coordinate and the pixel shader scales the opacity by
// GetParticleOpacity against the depth texture bound as custom map 00, over the SoftDepth attribute. Its two-fragment
// node library (generated NiMaterialNodeXMLLibraryParser shape, bodies regenerated by work/gb14/genlib.py) is never
// referenced in the exe. No __FILE__ strings; file name guessed from the class name.
